5,1,1,talk,Mio,,Hey everyone! Let's pick a great spot for the camp! I want to make sure the costs are fair for everyone this year.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Shizue,,It is lovely to see you all. I hope we can choose a place where everyone feels welcome and can truly bond.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,We should be practical. We need to consider the workload for the organizers so no one gets burnt out.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Rin,,I want somewhere exciting! But we can't have everyone grumpy and tired like last time. We need a place where we can actually sleep!,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Misaki,,I agree. We need a clear understanding of the expenses before we commit to any specific destination.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Mio,,"@Misaki, exactly! I'm worried about the extra spending. Maybe we should check how we've handled the money in the past?","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"That is a good point, Mio. I also wonder if we can find a way to encourage the different year-groups to mingle more.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Shizue, that's a social goal, but we first need to ensure the logistics are sustainable. I'll look into the duty rotations.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Rin,,"I'm going to find out where we can stay and if it's actually comfortable! I want a real adventure, not a nap-fest!","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Misaki,,I will look into the actual costs of the facilities and the transport records to avoid any surprises.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Mio,,I'll check the receipts and the booking process! I want to see if there are any hidden costs we missed.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Shizue,,I think I shall look into what the seniors have said about the year-groups and check the attendance sheets.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,I'll check the canteen closure and the cooking duties. We can't have the organizers spending all their time in the kitchen.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Rin,,"I'm curious about the beds and the whole-building lets! If we have the whole place, maybe it'll be quieter?","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Misaki,,"I'll also check the quoting terms for the buildings. We need a fixed price, not an estimate.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,pass,Mio,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false}"
21,1,4,pass,Shizue,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,I'll also check the accounts from the inland clubs to see if they had a lighter workload.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
23,1,4,pass,Ryuji,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
24,1,4,talk,Rin,,I'm all set! Let's find the coolest place ever!,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
25,1,4,pass,Misaki,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false}"
