36,2,1,talk,Mio,,"Wow, the transport costs are way higher if we go far! We really need to be careful about the budget.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Shizue,,I see. It seems some of our dear members didn't even attend the last camp. That makes me quite sad.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Ryuji,,I've found that cooking duties were a major burden last year. We should prioritize a place with a functioning canteen.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Rin,,"The beds are cheap, but the whole-building lets are scary! If someone gets sick and can't go, we still have to pay!","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,1,talk,Misaki,,"The prefecture rates are stable, but the private lets are risky. We cannot afford any unexpected deficits this year.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Mio,,"@Rin, that's exactly what I was worried about! If someone pulls out, who pays for their share of the building?","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"If we want everyone to feel they belong, perhaps we should choose a place that encourages us to spend time together.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Shizue, that's fine, but not if it means the organizers are stuck in the kitchen. We need a professional catering option.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Rin,,"But if we go to a public bed place, will it be too noisy? I don't want everyone to be zombies on the last day again!","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Mio, the club account cannot absorb more losses. We should avoid non-refundable deposits based on headcount.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Mio,,I agree with Misaki. Let's look for something with a flat fee that doesn't penalize us if someone drops out.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Shizue,,"I worry that if we prioritize only the budget, we might lose more members. We need a place that feels like a home.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Ryuji,,"A ""home"" that requires us to cook for thirty people is a nightmare. I strongly suggest a facility with a canteen.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Rin,,I want a place that's fun but quiet at night! Maybe the inland options are better? They sound like an adventure!,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,3,talk,Misaki,,"Inland options might be cheaper, but we must verify the transport costs first. We can't guess the budget.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Mio,,"Let's try to find a balance. A place with a canteen, a fair price, and a reasonable distance.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Shizue,,"As long as it is a place where the younger students feel comfortable talking to the older ones, I am happy.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Ryuji,,I will support any option that removes the cooking duty from the organizers. That is my primary concern.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Rin,,I just want to make sure we actually get some sleep! No more grumpy faces on the final day!,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
55,2,4,talk,Misaki,,I will vote for the option that provides the most financial certainty for the club.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
