61,3,1,talk,Mio,,"Option A is the safest for the budget, but Option B sounds like a real camp! I'm torn.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Shizue,,Option B's shared dormitories might be wonderful for bringing the year-groups together. It encourages natural conversation.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Ryuji,,Option C has meals arranged by the owner. That solves the cooking duty problem entirely.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Rin,,"Option B is a public facility, so it might be noisy. But Option A is just... school! That's not an adventure!","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,1,talk,Misaki,,"Option A is the only one with zero risk of a deficit. Option B is predictable, but Option C is too risky.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Mio,,"@Ryuji, Option C is far away, and remember the transport costs I found? It would be way too expensive!","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Rin, perhaps the noise of Option B is a small price to pay for the joy of making new friends across the club.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Mio, you're right about the distance. If C is too expensive, then B is the next best thing for the workload.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Rin,,"I don't want to be a zombie! If we go with B, can we make sure we get a quiet wing? I'm voting for B because A is boring!","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,2,talk,Misaki,,"Option B uses the prefecture rate sheet. It is a fixed cost per person, which is much safer than Option C.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Mio,,"If we go with B, we can keep the transport costs low and the per-person fee fair. I'm leaning towards B!","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Shizue,,I agree. The shared nature of the Mountain Training Centre will help our members bond and feel included.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Ryuji,,"I'll check if B has a canteen. If it's a public sports facility, it usually does. That's better than A or C.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Rin,,"Yay! B is an adventure! As long as we don't all end up awake at 3 AM, it'll be the best camp ever!","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,3,talk,Misaki,,Option B is acceptable. The costs are transparent and the risk of a budget shortfall is minimal compared to C.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,4,talk,Mio,,"It looks like we all agree on B! It's the best balance of cost, fun, and fairness.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,3,4,talk,Shizue,,I am so glad we could find a solution that considers everyone's needs. It will be a lovely trip.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,3,4,talk,Ryuji,,"As long as the organizers aren't spending their whole camp in a kitchen, I am satisfied with Option B.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,3,4,talk,Rin,,I can't wait! I'm going to pack my bags already! Let's go to the mountains!,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
80,3,4,talk,Misaki,,I agree. Option B is the most responsible choice for the club's finances.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
